    "detailed_description": "<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/810510/extras/061ebe28358f229765d8471134e115dc.poster.avif?t=1662351960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/810510/extras/061ebe28358f229765d8471134e115dc.webm?t=1662351960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/810510/extras/061ebe28358f229765d8471134e115dc.mp4?t=1662351960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Coming back home as a father is not an easy thing sometimes. You had a tough time at your office and you just want to sit back and relax at your new home. Next thing you know, you got your family against you. How long can you keep your sanity?<br><br>Game Features:<br>\u2022 This game is NOT meant to be easy. It is for challengers.<br>\u2022 The gameplay is quick and strategic.<br>\u2022 Playtime will depend on the skill of the player.<br>\u2022 The story can be ambiguous, but the story is scattered around in pieces.<br>\u2022 Please don't be a chicken and use headphones. :)<br>\u2022 Secret ending",
